Trans:
Soon, military conscripts from Ukraine may be allowed to travel abroad, according to **Minister of Economy Svirydenko**:
"We don't aim to allow everyone to travel; our goal is to help businesses that have the capacity to work to travel abroad for signing new contracts, agreements, participating in exhibitions, etc.," she stated.
In other words, this refers to men who are eligible for mobilization:
- Government employees and local self-government officials;
- Workers at enterprises with mobilization tasks assigned;
- Workers at enterprises producing goods for the needs of Ukrainian defense forces;
- Workers at critical infrastructure enterprises.

